### Phase 1 — Zope 5 REST API Test Requests
### Click "Send Request" (VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Make sure Zope is running first: runwsgi etc/zope.ini

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Health Check (Happy Path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-health
Accept: application/json

### 2. List All Employees (Happy Path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Employees by Department (English query param)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees?dept=Engineering
Accept: application/json

### 4. Filter Employees by Department (Japanese query param: 営業部 = Sales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees?dept=営業部
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Single Employee via Traversal (Happy Path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees/EMP-0001
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Non-Existent Employee (404 Error Envelope)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees/EMP-9999
Accept: application/json

### 7. Invalid Extra Path Segment (404 Error Envelope)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees/EMP-0001/extra
Accept: application/json

### 8. Open ZMI (Zope Management Interface — requires admin Basic Auth)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/manage
# Authorization: Basic admin:admin
